stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IngestTriggered: User submits URL or ZIP
    IngestTriggered --> ValidateArchive: Security Scan (ZipBomb, Symlink Traversal)
    
    ValidateArchive --> Rejected: Malicious path or size > 200MB
    Rejected --> [*]
    
    ValidateArchive --> ExtractSnapshot: Unpack into /data/snapshots/{repo_id}
    ExtractSnapshot --> FilterFiles: Ignore binaries, .git, vendor directories
    
    FilterFiles --> ParseAST: Tree-sitter parsing for symbols & imports
    ParseAST --> RedactSecrets: Detect & mask high-entropy secrets and keys
    RedactSecrets --> ChunkCode: AST-aware chunking (max 500 tokens, 50 overlap)
    
    ChunkCode --> BuildEmbeddings: Generate dense vector embeddings
    BuildEmbeddings --> StoreChroma: Upsert vectors into ChromaDB
    
    ChunkCode --> IndexBM25: Build sparse lexical BM25 index
    ParseAST --> BuildGraph: Construct NetworkX dependency & call graph
    
    StoreChroma --> MarkReady: Update status to 'ready'
    IndexBM25 --> MarkReady
    BuildGraph --> MarkReady
    
    MarkReady --> [*]
